<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-melanogaster-turing-wavelength-s0-code-traceability> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Drosophila melanogaster Schnakenberg Turing wavelength at 2.736 µm (Holocene, 0 Ma) — Code-to-model traceability: 84/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "The module docstring states the PDE, the dispersion formula, and the three parameter rows. Jacobian, sigma, gamma solve, simulator, FFT, and the GoF each occupy a named function. The Lean module records the wavelength order, the 8-wave patch, the nanometre gaps, the diffusion inequality, and u0 = a + b, with zero sorry. Deduction: Lean was not executed here (no lean binary), and there is no line map onto numbered equations of Turing 1952." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-code-traceability> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/code-traceability" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-melanogaster-turing-wavelength-s0-code-traceability-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-melanogaster-turing-wavelength-s0-code-traceability-2>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-melanogaster-turing-wavelength-s0-code-traceability-3> ;
    pk:hasScore 8.4e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-melanogaster-turing-wavelength-s0-model-fidelity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Drosophila melanogaster Schnakenberg Turing wavelength at 2.736 µm (Holocene, 0 Ma) — Model fidelity to source: 90/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "The script implements Schnakenberg kinetics, the gamma-scaled Jacobian, sigma(k), the Turing margin h^2 - 4 Du Dv det(J), and gamma solved so k_c matches 2 pi / 2.736 µm^-1. The equal-diffusion control has a negative margin and a collapsed field. Deduction: the integrator is explicit Euler, and the kinetics are Schnakenberg rather than a Drosophila-specific transport law. Yellow and Ebony are cited as the biological context, not as separate state variables." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-model-fidelity> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/model-fidelity" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-melanogaster-turing-wavelength-s0-model-fidelity-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-melanogaster-turing-wavelength-s0-model-fidelity-2>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-melanogaster-turing-wavelength-s0-model-fidelity-3> ;
    pk:hasScore 9e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-melanogaster-turing-wavelength-s0-morphometric-validation> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Drosophila melanogaster Schnakenberg Turing wavelength at 2.736 µm (Holocene, 0 Ma) — Morphometric validation: 86/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Dispersion goodness-of-fit on 13 patterned-band modes: Pearson r = 0.9999999989 (reference 1, not equal), RMSE = 4.62e-5 (reference 0). The nonlinear FFT wavelength is 2.799 µm against the 2.736 µm target (2.3% long), so the field metric is not a copy of the target. Specimen foreground fraction is 0.505 (reference 0.50, not equal), contour circularity 0.044 against a circle at 1, and structure-tensor coherency 0.464. Equal-diffusion std ratio is about 1496 (reference 1). The KS statistic of residuals against an independent normal is 0.726 (p ~ 4e-7): the residuals are tighter and less Gaussian than that reference. That is reported, not hidden, and it is why this dimension is not in the 90s." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-morphometric-validation> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/morphometric-validation" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-melanogaster-turing-wavelength-s0-measurement-chronospecies-lambda-gap-mauritiana-um>,
