    rdfs:label "Drosophila melanogaster Schnakenberg Turing wavelength at 2.736 µm (Holocene, 0 Ma) (Drosophila melanogaster)",
        "Drosophila melanogaster Schnakenberg Turing wavelength at 2.736 µm (Holocene, 0 Ma) faithfully reproduces Drosophila melanogaster morphology" ;
    dct:conformsTo <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/math-law/delphi10000-drosophila-melanogaster-turing-wavelength-s0-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/math-law/delphi10000-drosophila-melanogaster-turing-wavelength-s0-2>,
